{"ref":"BDB, צְרוֹר","hw":"צְרוֹר","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צְרוֹר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:6\" href=\"/Haggai.1.6\">Hg 1:6</a></sup> <strong>bundle, parcel, pouch, bag (</strong>proposes <em>a binding</em>, i.e. sthg. bound up<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:9\" href=\"/Amos.9.9\">Am 9:9</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:35\" href=\"/Genesis.42.35\">Gn 42:35</a> +; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צְרֹרוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:35\" href=\"/Genesis.42.35\">35</a>;—<em>bundle</em> or <em>pouch</em> (purse) of money <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:35\" href=\"/Genesis.42.35\">42:35</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (E), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.20\">Pr 7:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ הַמֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.13\">Ct 1:13</a> (fig. of lover); <span dir=\"rtl\">צְרוּרָה בִּצ׳ הַחַיִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.29\">1 S 25:29</a> (fig.; v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צָרַר\" href=\"/BDB,_צָרַר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. צרר</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">חָתֻם בִּצ׳ פִּשְׁעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:17\" href=\"/Job.14.17\">Jb 14:17</a> (i.e. hidden, forgotten Hi Bu al.; > al. <em>treasured up</em>), <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ נָקוּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:6\" href=\"/Haggai.1.6\">Hg 1:6</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָקַב\" href=\"/BDB,_נָקַב\", dir=\"rtl\">I. נקב</a>).","next":"BDB, מֵצַר²","prev":"BDB, צָרַר²"}